From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 06:56:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] hybris: fall back to droid_media_init on older Android sides

Android-side libdroidmedia builds from before 7360103 (2021, the package
split) export droid_media_init, not _droid_media_init. The glibc side
asked only for the new name and aborted in __resolve_sym, so every
droidmedia user died at start on such images. The HP TouchPad's
Android 9 system image is one of them.

Try _droid_media_init first and fall back to the old name.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 hybris.c | 18 ++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hybris.c b/hybris.c
index 81067af..4457e59 100644
--- a/hybris.c
+++ b/hybris.c
@@ -250,7 +250,6 @@ HYBRIS_WRAPPER_0_1(DroidMediaCodec *, droid_media_codec_drain);
 HYBRIS_WRAPPER_1_1(DroidMediaCodecLoopReturn,DroidMediaCodec*,droid_media_codec_loop);
 HYBRIS_WRAPPER_0_3(DroidMediaCodec*,DroidMediaCodecMetaData*,DroidMediaRect*,droid_media_codec_get_output_info);
 HYBRIS_WRAPPER_1_2(bool,DroidMediaCodec*,int32_t,droid_media_codec_set_video_encoder_bitrate);
-HYBRIS_WRAPPER_0_0(_droid_media_init)
 HYBRIS_WRAPPER_0_0(droid_media_deinit)
 HYBRIS_WRAPPER_1_2(DroidMediaBuffer*,DroidMediaBufferQueue*,DroidMediaBufferCallbacks*,droid_media_buffer_queue_acquire_buffer)
 HYBRIS_WRAPPER_0_3(DroidMediaBufferQueue*,DroidMediaBufferQueueCallbacks*,void*,droid_media_buffer_queue_set_callbacks)
@@ -314,9 +313,16 @@ bool droid_media_camera_set_torch_mode(bool enabled)
 
 bool droid_media_init(void)
 {
-  if (__init_glue()) {
-    _droid_media_init();
-    return true;
-  }
-  return false;
+  void (*init)(void);
+
+  if (!__init_glue())
+    return false;
+
+  /* Android-side builds from before the 2021 package split export the
+   * old name. */
+  init = __try_resolve_sym("_droid_media_init");
+  if (!init)
+    init = __resolve_sym("droid_media_init");
+  init();
+  return true;
 }
